description:
77 percent EXTRA WIDE PLATES: More hair can be captured in a single pass from root to tip; The design is ideal for smoothing and controlling all hair types but is especially suited for styling thicker hair;
CERAMIC ULTRA COATED PLATES: The Advanced Ceramic Ultra coated plates are 75 percent smoother to glide effortlessly through hair for snag-free styling and a smooth finish;
DIGITAL TEMPERATURE CONTROL: Whether your hair is thick or fine, the digital temperature control gives you a choice of 9 settings from 150-230°C so you can select the right level of heat for your hair type;
